# ALDAP Samba AD test bench (deploy/samba-dc): loaded by provision.py after
# `samba-tool domain provision`. 2 OUs + CN=Users, 20 users (2 disabled), 5 computers,
# groups Staff > Managers > Directors (nested, in CN=Users). No passwords here:
# provision.py sets them from the generated secrets.

